            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The provisions of this Agreement, unless otherwise provided herein, shall become applicable upon the commencement of the term specified in Section A-1 above except that all amendments hereto, made after the effective date of the Agreement, shall become effective on the individual dates agreed upon.",
