        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Prior to the expiration term in Section A.1, the parties may mutually agree in writing to modify the twenty (20) calendar day notice of termination period specified in Section B.1. If this occurs, then this Agreement shall expire as of the expiration term specified in Section A.1 or five (5) calendar days after the date of the foregoing mutual agreement, whichever is later.",
